# Secrets for S2T (per-user).
# This file is optional and loaded by systemd user services.
# Permissions should be 0600.
#
# OpenAI API key (do not commit):
# S2T_OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...

# Google Cloud API key (do not commit):
# S2T_GOOGLE_API_KEY=AIza...
#
# Google Speech-to-Text v2 (Chirp) does NOT use API keys; it uses OAuth/ADC (gcloud).
